[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_00_0010","text":"明天你们俩\n都能放一天假了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_00_0020","text":"……啊——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_00_0030","text":"不不\n越是这种时候，越要好好休息！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_00_0040","text":"这样啊……\n那，哪里有空的练习室吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_00_0005","text":"难得放假\n休息吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_00_0006","text":"好像\n有空着的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_00_0007","text":"应该\n没有空着的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_01_0010","text":"…………这样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_01_0020","text":"你们看起来很不满啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_02_0010","text":"真的？\n那，我去预约那里吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_02_0020","text":"那个，我也能一起去吗……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_03_0010","text":"这样……\n那我得去找别的地方了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07100000_03_0020","text":"我是想让你们休息的啊……"}]
